h any Scheduler links. The flag can also be unset. When the value of the flag is unset (`null`), the flag defaults to 'Busy' if it has a time set, and 'Free' if it is an all-day event without specified time.\",\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"company_id\":{\"description\":\"The user's company ID\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"conference_meeting_client\":{\"description\":\"The ID of the Marketplace app, which is connected to this activity\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"conference_meeting_id\":{\"description\":\"The meeting ID of the meeting provider (Zoom, MS Teams etc.) that is associated with this activity\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"conference_meeting_url\":{\"description\":\"The link to join the meeting which is associated with this activity\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"done\":{\"description\":\"Whether the activity is done or not\",\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"id\":{\"description\":\"The ID of the activity, generated when the activity was created\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"location_admin_area_level_1\":{\"description\":\"A subfield of the location field. Indicates state/county.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"location_admin_area_level_2\":{\"description\":\"A subfield of the location field. Indicates region.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"location_country\":{\"description\":\"A subfield of the location field. Indicates country.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"location_formatted_address\":{\"description\":\"A subfield of the location field. Indicates full/combined address.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"location_locality\":{\"description\":\"A subfield of the location field. Indicates city/town/village/locality.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"location_postal_code\":{\"description\":\"A subfield of the location field. Indicates ZIP/postal code.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"location_route\":{\"description\":\"A subfield of the location field. Indicates street name.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"location_street_number\":{\"description\":\"A subfield of the location field. Indicates house number.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"location_sublocality\":{\"description\":\"A subfield of the location field. Indicates district/sublocality.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"location_subpremise\":{\"description\":\"A subfield of the location field. Indicates apartment/suite number.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"marked_as_done_time\":{\"description\":\"The date and time this activity was marked as done. Format: YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"source_timezone\":{\"description\":\"The timezone the activity was created in an external calendar\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"subject\":{\"description\":\"The subject of the activity\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":{\"description\":\"The type of the activity. This is in correlation with the `key_string` parameter of ActivityTypes.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"update_time\":{\"description\":\"The last update date and time of the activity. Format: YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"update_user_id\":{\"description\":\"The ID of the user who was the last to update this activity\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"user_id\":{\"description\":\"The ID of the user whom the activity is assigned to\",\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"type\":\"object\"}],\"title\":\"ActivityCollectionResponseObject\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"success\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"}},\"title\":\"GetActivitiesCollectionResponse\",\"type\":\"object\"}}},\"description\":\"A collection of activities\"}},\"security\":[{\"api_key\":[]},{\"oauth2\":[\"projects:read\",\"projects:full\"]}],\"securitySchemes\":{\"api_key\":{\"in\":\"header\",\"name\":\"x-api-token\",\"type\":\"apiKey\"},\"basic_authentication\":{\"description\":\"Base 64 encoded string containing the `client_id` and `client_secret` values. The header value should be `Basic <base64(client_id:client_secret)>`.\",\"scheme\":\"basic\",\"type\":\"http\"},\"oauth2\":{\"description\":\"For more information, see https://pipedrive.readme.io/docs/marketplace-oauth-authorization\",\"flows\":{\"authorizationCode\":{\"authorizationUrl\":\"https://oauth.pipedrive.com/oauth/authorize\",\